ros-humble-openvino-wrapper-lib (1.1.0-1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Add Ultralytics YOLO26 models for object detection, instance segmentation
    and semantic segmentation (model_type yolo26).
  * Add the KeypointDetection, OrientedObjectDetection, ImageClassification
    and DepthEstimation inferences with their YOLO26 models, outputs and topics.
  * Warn when a label file cannot be read or does not cover a class id.
  * Publish the mask of each segmented object without the masks of the
    objects before it.

